'''Litwick Cave''' (Japanese: '''ヒトモシ{{tt|洞窟|どうくつ}}''' ''{{tt|Hitomoshi|Litwick}} Cave'') is a cave located in the North End disctrict of [[Ryme City]] in the game {{OBP|Detective Pikachu|video game}}. It is a damp cave with underground water flowing through it<ref>Detective Pikachu Ryme City Guide</ref>, and is one of the city's famous spots, being popular with tourists as well as with couples. Most of Chapter 2 in Detective Pikachu takes place here.

